<body data-page="00">
  <nav data-site-nav aria-label="dSpark 学习站导航"></nav>

  <main class="page page--wide">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">00 · 运行时所有权 / 单轮执行地图</p>
      <h1>dSpark 一轮执行，不是一堵对象卡片墙</h1>
      <p class="lead">从 <code>Scheduler.model_worker</code> 的动态接收者开始，沿真实实例所有权、Target/Draft 两套 runner 与一轮状态闭环定位每个阶段；细节只在对应子页展开。</p>
      <div class="evidence-strip">
        <span><strong>源码版本</strong> f01a0c7f97ec</span>
        <span><strong>执行路径</strong> CUDA/ROCm 通用 <code>TpModelWorker</code> · PP=1；折叠尾处理器仅支持 NVIDIA CUDA</span>
        <span><strong>证据范围</strong> 当前源码静态追踪 · 本轮未执行 GPU 运行时验证</span>
      </div>
      <div class="route-switch" aria-label="选择讲解路线">
        <button type="button" data-route-choice="static-greedy">STATIC · 贪心</button>
        <button type="button" data-route-choice="compact-sampling">COMPACT · 随机采样</button>
        <button type="button" data-route-choice="folded-greedy">FOLDED · 贪心</button>
      </div>
      <div data-semantic-legend></div>
    </header>

    <section class="handoff" aria-label="本页边界">
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输入</b><span><code>scheduler : Scheduler</code> 已选择 dSpark 投机解码算法</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>本页确认</b><span><code>scheduler.model_worker</code> 的运行时接收者与其内部实例所有权</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输出</b><span><code>GenerationBatchResult(next_draft_input=DFlashDraftInputV2(...))</code></span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>后继章节</b><span>01 Scheduler 隔离 / 02 Prefill 启动 / 03 Decode 提案</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="architecture">
      <div class="section__head">
        <p class="section__kicker">组件架构</p>
        <h2>谁持有谁，谁真正接到 <code>run_batch()</code></h2>
        <p class="section__intro"><code>scheduler.model_worker</code> 在 dSpark 下指向 <code>DSparkWorkerV2</code>；Target 的通用 <code>TpModelWorker</code> 被它保存在 <code>self._target_worker</code> 内。绿色是 Python 主调用，蓝色是对象/数据，紫色虚线是 CUDA 图与设备路径。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="architecture-story" data-architecture-story>
        <div class="architecture-story__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="分三张子图学习运行时对象关系">
          <button type="button" role="tab" data-arch-scene="0" aria-selected="true"><span>子图 1 / 3</span><b>Scheduler 如何进入 dSpark</b></button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" data-arch-scene="1" aria-selected="false"><span>子图 2 / 3</span><b>dSpark 内部怎样分工</b></button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" data-arch-scene="2" aria-selected="false"><span>子图 3 / 3</span><b>模型执行如何回到下一轮</b></button>
        </div>
        <div class="architecture-story__stage">
          <article class="architecture-scene" data-arch-panel="0" aria-hidden="false">
            <header><span>入口与动态接收者</span><h3><code>Scheduler.run_batch()</code> 调到的不是普通 Target worker</h3><p>先只回答“调用落到谁”：同一个 <code>ScheduleBatch</code> 被交给 <code>scheduler.model_worker</code>，而 dSpark 配置下这个字段指向 <code>scheduler.draft_worker : DSparkWorkerV2</code>。</p></header>
            <div class="architecture-flow architecture-flow--entry">
              <div class="story-node" data-kind="main" data-object-ref="scheduler"><b>scheduler : Scheduler</b><code>Scheduler.run_batch()</code><span>发起本轮执行</span></div>
              <div class="story-arrow"><b>batch_to_run</b><span>Python 调用</span></div>
              <div class="story-node" data-kind="data" data-object-ref="batch"><b>batch : ScheduleBatch</b><code>input_ids / seq_lens / spec_info</code><span>本轮工作视图与跨轮状态</span></div>
              <div class="story-arrow"><b>forward_batch_generation(batch)</b><span>receiver = scheduler.model_worker · 动态分派</span></div>
              <div class="story-node" data-kind="main" data-object-ref="dspark"><b>scheduler.model_worker</b><code>is scheduler.draft_worker<br>: DSparkWorkerV2</code><span>真正接收 run_batch 的协调器</span></div>
            </div>
            <footer><b>本图交出</b><span><code>self : DSparkWorkerV2</code>，下一张只展开它内部持有的四个职责组件。</span><button type="button" data-arch-next="1">继续：内部组件 →</button></footer>
          </article>

          <article class="architecture-scene" data-arch-panel="1" aria-hidden="true">
            <header><span>协调器内部的职责分解</span><h3>一个 <code>DSparkWorkerV2</code> 组合四个长期复用实例</h3><p>这些不是四轮执行，也不是四份模型；它们共同完成同一轮的提案、规划、Target 验证和已接受 hidden 的 KV 提交。</p></header>
            <div class="story-hub">
              <div class="story-node story-node--hub" data-kind="main" data-object-ref="dspark"><b>self : DSparkWorkerV2</b><code>forward_batch_generation()</code><span>统一编排和共同尾部</span></div>
              <div class="story-component-grid">
                <div class="story-node" data-kind="main" data-object-ref="proposer"><b>self._proposer</b><code>DraftBlockProposer.propose()</code><span>输入 rolling anchor，产生 DraftProposal</span></div>
                <div class="story-node" data-kind="guard" data-object-ref="planner"><b>self._verify_planner</b><code>DSparkVerifyPlanner.schedule_layout()</code><span>budget → verify_lens → layout</span></div>
                <div class="story-node" data-kind="main" data-object-ref="executor"><b>self._verify_executor</b><code>TargetVerifyExecutor.run_*()</code><span>装配 Target Verify 并返回 TargetVerifyResult</span></div>
                <div class="story-node" data-kind="data" data-object-ref="injector"><b>self._kv_injector</b><code>TargetHiddenKvInjector.commit_hidden()</code><span>只写 anchor + accepted drafts 的 Draft KV</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="story-order"><span>① proposal</span><i>→</i><span>② layout</span><i>→</i><span>③ target verify</span><i>→</i><span>④ accept / commit</span></div>
            <footer><button type="button" data-arch-next="0">← 返回入口</button><span><b>本图交出</b> proposer 与 executor 分别调用 Draft/Target 模型执行；下一张追到 runner、attention 和结果回收。</span><button type="button" data-arch-next="2">继续：模型执行 →</button></footer>
          </article>

          <article class="architecture-scene" data-arch-panel="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <header><span>两套 runner 与共同结果尾部</span><h3>Draft 和 Target 各自 forward，最终汇入同一个 <code>GenerationBatchResult</code></h3><p>紫色是设备执行位置；绿色是 Python 控制/采用。CUDA Graph 是否命中只改变执行位置，不改变最后交给 Scheduler 的结果合同。</p></header>
            <div class="story-dual-runner">
              <section><h4>Draft 分支</h4><div class="story-node" data-kind="main" data-object-ref="proposer"><b>self._proposer</b><span>构造 [anchor,MASK,…]</span></div><div class="story-arrow story-arrow--down"><b>draft_model_runner.forward()</b></div><div class="story-node" data-kind="cuda" data-object-ref="draft-runner"><b>self._draft_worker.model_runner</b><code>ModelRunner</code><span>一次 G 行 Transformer；Markov 尾部另行串行采样</span></div></section>
              <section><h4>Target 分支</h4><div class="story-node" data-kind="main" data-object-ref="target-worker"><b>self._target_worker : TpModelWorker</b><span>forward_batch_generation(is_verify=True)</span></div><div class="story-arrow story-arrow--down"><b>model_runner.forward(verify_forward_batch)</b></div><div class="story-node" data-kind="cuda" data-object-ref="target-runner"><b>self._target_worker.model_runner</b><code>DecodeCudaGraphRunner | EagerRunner</code><span>Target logits + FULL auxiliary hidden</span></div><div class="story-node story-node--compact" data-kind="cuda" data-object-ref="attention"><b>attn_backend : AttentionBackend</b><span>读取 DFlashVerifyInput attention metadata</span></div></section>
              <section><h4>共同尾部</h4><div class="story-node" data-kind="data" data-object-ref="result"><b>TargetVerifyResult</b><span>logits / hidden / graph hit</span></div><div class="story-arrow story-arrow--down"><b>accept + commit_hidden</b></div><div class="story-node" data-kind="main" data-object-ref="result"><b>GenerationBatchResult</b><code>next_token_ids / accept_lens / next_draft_input</code><span>交回 Scheduler.process_batch_result()</span></div></section>
            </div>
            <footer><button type="button" data-arch-next="1">← 返回内部组件</button><span><b>闭环</b> <code>next_draft_input.bonus_tokens</code> 成为下一轮 Draft 的 anchor。</span><a href="#lifecycle">继续：对象闭环 ↓</a></footer>
          </article>
        </div>
