      <div class="identity-contract" aria-label="运行时对象引用等式">
        <div class="identity-contract__item">
          <b>外层调用接收者</b>
          <code>scheduler.model_worker is scheduler.draft_worker</code>
          <span>两者都指向同一个 <code>DSparkWorkerV2</code>；<code>Scheduler.run_batch()</code> 因此先进入 dSpark 编排层。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="identity-contract__item">
          <b>Target 实例与 runner</b>
          <code>scheduler.tp_worker is scheduler.model_worker._target_worker<br>self.model_runner is self._target_worker.model_runner</code>
          <span><code>TargetVerifyExecutor.target_worker</code> 也引用这个 Target worker；不是另一份 Target 模型。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="identity-contract__item">
          <b>KV 注入器共享</b>
          <code>self._kv_injector is self._verify_executor.kv_injector</code>
          <span>验证执行器与轮末提交使用同一个 <code>TargetHiddenKvInjector</code>，避免把两个字段误读成两个组件实例。</span>
        </div>
      </div>
