    <section class="section" id="routes">
      <div class="section__head">
        <p class="section__kicker">三条运行路线</p>
        <h2>三条路线经过同一组持有者，只改变分支与执行位置</h2>
        <p class="section__intro">切换路线只高亮，不隐藏其它事实。这样可以看见回退路径最终重新汇入同一个接受、提交与 Scheduler 尾部。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="route-ribbons">
        <div class="route-ribbon" data-routes="static-greedy"><div class="route-ribbon__name">STATIC · 贪心</div><div class="route-ribbon__flow"><span class="route-stop">DraftProposal</span><span class="route-stop" data-kind="guard">layout = None</span><span class="route-stop">完整 Target B×W</span><span class="route-stop">AcceptGreedy</span><span class="route-stop">提交 + 下一轮锚点</span></div></div>
        <div class="route-ribbon" data-routes="compact-sampling"><div class="route-ribbon__name">COMPACT · 随机采样</div><div class="route-ribbon__flow"><span class="route-stop">置信度 + 预算</span><span class="route-stop" data-kind="guard">RaggedVerifyLayout</span><span class="route-stop" data-kind="cuda">压紧后的 Target</span><span class="route-stop">AcceptSampling</span><span class="route-stop">提交 + 下一轮锚点</span></div></div>
        <div class="route-ribbon" data-routes="folded-greedy"><div class="route-ribbon__name">FOLDED · 贪心 · 仅 NVIDIA CUDA</div><div class="route-ribbon__flow"><span class="route-stop">折叠 DraftProposal</span><span class="route-stop" data-kind="guard">压紧 + CUDA 图 + is_cuda()</span><span class="route-stop" data-kind="cuda">Target 图回放</span><span class="route-stop" data-kind="cuda">尾处理器内散射 + 接受</span><span class="route-stop">统一结果尾部</span></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="entry-map" aria-label="Prefill、Decode 与 Folded 覆盖层">
        <div class="entry-map__head">
          <b>先分生命周期入口，再看验证策略</b>
          <span>下面是 Prefill / Decode 的调用阶段；上面的 STATIC / COMPACT / FOLDED 是 Decode 内部怎样验证，两个维度不能混成一个枚举。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="entry-row" data-kind="guard">
          <div class="entry-row__label"><b>PREFILL · 启动桥</b><span>01 是外层隔离壳</span></div>
          <div class="entry-flow">
            <a class="entry-step" data-kind="guard" data-nav href="dspark-forward-isolation.html"><b>01 · 进入隔离区</b><span><code>ScheduleBatch(EXTEND)</code> 临时工作视图</span></a>
            <a class="entry-step" data-nav href="dspark-prefill-bootstrap.html"><b>02 · Prefill 启动</b><span>prompt → Target hidden → Draft KV + 首个锚点</span></a>
            <a class="entry-step" data-kind="guard" data-nav href="dspark-forward-isolation.html#transaction-flow"><b>01 · 恢复并提交</b><span><code>next_draft_input</code> 成为跨轮状态</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="entry-row">
          <div class="entry-row__label"><b>DECODE · 一轮主链</b><span>03–07 在隔离壳内部</span></div>
          <div class="entry-flow">
            <a class="entry-step" data-kind="guard" data-nav href="dspark-forward-isolation.html"><b>01 · 临时工作视图</b><span><code>ScheduleBatch</code> 事务式重绑</span></a>
            <a class="entry-step" data-nav href="dspark-draft-proposal.html"><b>03 · Draft</b><span><code>DraftProposal</code></span></a>
            <a class="entry-step" data-nav href="dspark-confidence-budget-layout.html"><b>04 · 规划</b><span>budget / layout</span></a>
            <a class="entry-step" data-nav href="dspark-verify-step-through.html"><b>05 · Target</b><span><code>TargetVerifyResult</code></span></a>
            <a class="entry-step" data-nav href="dspark-accept-finalize.html"><b>06 · 接受</b><span><code>AcceptOuts</code></span></a>
            <a class="entry-step" data-nav href="dspark-target-hidden-kv-explainer.html"><b>07 · KV / Result</b><span><code>GenerationBatchResult</code></span></a>
            <a class="entry-step" data-kind="guard" data-nav href="dspark-forward-isolation.html#transaction-flow"><b>01 · 持久提交</b><span>恢复临时字段，显式提交下一轮状态</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="entry-row" data-kind="cuda" data-routes="folded-greedy">
          <div class="entry-row__label"><b>FOLDED · 覆盖层</b><span>不是第四条业务流水线</span></div>
          <div class="entry-flow">
            <a class="entry-step" data-kind="guard" data-nav href="dspark-folded-fast-path.html"><b>08 · 分段 guard</b><span>proposal / accept / commit 各自判定</span></a>
            <a class="entry-step" data-kind="cuda" data-nav href="dspark-folded-capture-replay.html"><b>08A · 图内执行</b><span>可折叠阶段移入 capture / replay</span></a>
            <a class="entry-step" data-nav href="dspark-target-hidden-kv-explainer.html"><b>07 · 重新汇入</b><span>仍交出相同的结果与跨轮状态契约</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="lifecycle">
      <div class="section__head">
        <p class="section__kicker">一轮状态闭环</p>
        <h2>对象闭环：一轮的 bonus 是下一轮的锚点</h2>
        <p class="section__intro">控制调用结束并不等于状态消失；<code>next_draft_input</code> 把接受阶段产生的 bonus 与新长度送回下一轮。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="visual">
        <div class="visual__bar"><strong>一轮执行 · 对象交接</strong><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#round-cycle">放大闭环</button></div>
        <div class="visual__body canvas-scroll">
          <div class="cycle-track" id="round-cycle">
            <div class="cycle-object"><b>DFlashDraftInputV2</b><span>本轮输入：bonus_tokens / new_seq_lens / 历史 confidence</span></div>
            <div class="cycle-object"><b>VerifyWindow + DraftProposal</b><span>anchor + draft_tokens / corrected_logits / 当前 confidence</span></div>
            <div class="cycle-object"><b>RaggedVerifyLayout | None</b><span>可选规划：how many / where / CUDA 图档位</span></div>
            <div class="cycle-object"><b>TargetVerifyResult</b><span>logits_output（其中携带 H_aux）+ can_run_cuda_graph</span></div>
            <div class="cycle-object"><b>AcceptOuts</b><span>correct_len / bonus / commit_lens</span></div>
            <div class="cycle-object"><b>Draft KV + 下一轮锚点</b><span>写入的是已提交输入的 hidden；输出 bonus 只是下一轮 anchor</span></div>
            <div class="cycle-object"><b>GenerationBatchResult</b><span>next_token_ids / accept_lens / next_draft_input → ScheduleBatch commit</span></div>
            <div class="cycle-return" aria-label="GenerationBatchResult 中的 next_draft_input 回到下一轮 DFlashDraftInputV2"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="questions">
      <div class="section__head">
        <p class="section__kicker">按问题进入</p>
        <h2>从最容易卡住的六个问题，直接进入对应专题</h2>
        <p class="section__intro">这些入口来自源码学习过程中反复出现的困惑。主阶段负责交代边界，专题页负责把时间线、张量和失败后果完整展开。</p>
      </div>
