    <section class="section" id="stages">
      <div class="section__head">
        <p class="section__kicker">分阶段阅读</p>
        <h2>沿唯一持有者深入，不在总图重复算法</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="canvas-scroll">
        <nav class="stage-map" aria-label="dSpark 分阶段学习页面">
          <a data-nav href="dspark-forward-isolation.html"><b>01 · 隔离</b><span>ScheduleBatch 临时 verify 视图与恢复</span><dl><div><dt>接收</dt><dd>batch_to_run : ScheduleBatch</dd></div><div><dt>交出</dt><dd>恢复 + 提交 next_draft_input</dd></div></dl></a>
